Z||000000||polomeno||08-30-2001||02:47 PM||||Hey guys any idea? my lifters were pretty noisy.. i tried various oil additives and they didnt seem to work and i planned on replacing lifters.. but today when i went out it is burning massive amounts of oil out the back.. on idle, acceleration, and cruising..||||reg||1
Z||000001||Steve Normington||08-30-2001||03:13 PM||||Sorry to say this, but it seems to me like it is engine rebuild time. Noisy lifters were most likely low oil pressure (worn bearings). Burning oil at all times is probably bad rings.||||reg||1
Z||000002||86seyellow||08-31-2001||08:37 PM||||Yep, same thing here. Didnt have the lifter noise just 3rd cylinder no fire and lots of burning oil. I ordered a new crate engien for $1200<BR><P>------------------<BR>if you saw a yellow streak go by you really fast it was a fiero<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fieropix1.JPG"> ||||reg||1
